{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:04:40.856018Z","id":"4ba1bef88ebee53d292310430277264c9ef9869541a73a5d4f6f351041abf6c7","body":{"detail":"node web/scripts/bundle-size.mjs measures artifact at 64069 gzip bytes against a budget of 64006 on bbc15627 itself (built from git archive in a scratch copy), so the bundle gate fails before and after the People page, whose change leaves the artifact entry at exactly 64069. Either trim the artifact entry or set its budget deliberately.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":4},"end":{"line":4},"content_hash":"03497708e9bcb00afb12a07f9067b13d6cf757e45d9906b71e1d98901e1f7eee"},"summary":"The artifact entry is over its budget at bbc15627","tags":["session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T02:37:47.228703Z","id":"ef25f5928ead5b4920d5d7305ca71fe4423abc5223ed7e31bfce165c5ae7558c","body":{"kind":"comment","references":"4ba1bef88ebee53d292310430277264c9ef9869541a73a5d4f6f351041abf6c7","summary":"Measured per commit (npm run build, node scripts/bundle-size.mjs): 64006 at ffd6520b, the last deliberate raise; 4871da0f +14 (x-clax-via: page on the assets, db and comments capabilities), bba24eb6 +43 (threads.ts sendToAgent's page marker and approval routing), 9028b32f +6 (the agents event refetch in the artifact view); 64069 from 9028b32f on, unchanged by f2d449fc. The growth is spec-required behaviour in the artifact view, 0.1% of the entry.","tags":["review","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T03:02:20.888691Z","id":"771208c5bda950dac2d8d1c4822cdc9ad7ed45112cc1341fef029df463fb331c","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:900e6485","summary":"The budget is 64069 in web/perf/bundle-budget.json. Evidence: npm run build && node scripts/bundle-size.mjs exits 0 with 'artifact 64069' after 55443491.","supersedes":"4ba1bef88ebee53d292310430277264c9ef9869541a73a5d4f6f351041abf6c7","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T04:23:02.671449Z","id":"8655f2aeb3861adbeea4196f6dfc8aae6042be25d5bdbf7d46997880c4885481","body":{"detail":"The live layers raised three budgets to their measured sizes in a commit of their own (artifact 64069 to 64793, bridge 5501 to 5612, partComment 11821 to 13723). The tags, the writers, the live colours and the socket already load after the first paint (web/shell/src/view/live-view.ts, web/shell/src/ui/PeerTags.svelte, web/shell/src/ui/LiveWriters.svelte); what is left in the entry is the controller's hand-off (web/shell/src/view/artifact-controller.ts startLive, liveText, the frame messages), and in the eager bridge the comment part's wiring of web/bridge/src/live.ts. Options: keep the raise; or move the hand-off behind one dynamic import and the bridge's peers and quotes wiring into the comment part, for perhaps half the entry's growth. The extension's panel (its ceiling 65536) stays under at 65204.","kind":"comment","span":{"start":{"line":4},"end":{"line":8},"content_hash":"40c55dca1bfc9f3e01468d0f65d7459d036130f86a82135bb63fda866de5b51b"},"summary":"Raise or refuse: the live layers' bundle growth (artifact +724, eager bridge +111, comment part +1902 gzip bytes)","tags":["live-layers","status:needs-decision","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:16:01.911127Z","id":"69e407ee059cebaafe2ceb196295ca2828565552f1076e15561c0cedf0d93e44","body":{"detail":"Measured with node web/scripts/bundle-size.mjs after npm run build: artifact 64243 (budget was 64069), eager bridge 5548 (was 5501; 5462 at 66d2a8f3), comment part 11273 (its budget 11821 kept), the new live part 4197 (budget 4616). The budgets for artifact and bridge are set to those sizes. The drawing, the pointer reports and the quote highlight are the bridge's live part (web/bridge/src/live.ts, loaded by web/bridge/src/live-hook.ts for the first open quote or the first clax:peers naming someone or saying here); the tags, writers, socket and colours load after the first paint with presence (web/shell/src/view/presence-live.ts). What is left: in the entry, the controller's hand-off (web/shell/src/view/artifact-controller.ts startLive, about 70 bytes; react, hello and left, about 20; the clax:cursor/peer-at case, about 19; the open threads' highlight flag, about 13); in the eager bridge, the live part's loader (about 13), the clax:peers case and its SHELL_TYPES entry (about 12), the quotes call in resolveAll (about 12) and making the hook and handing it to comment mode. Removing each was measured; none of it can move to a lazy chunk without the entry or the bridge keeping a call to it. Options: keep these budgets; or refuse and drop a layer (the quote highlight saves about 12 bridge bytes and 13 entry bytes).","kind":"comment","span":{"start":{"line":4},"end":{"line":6},"content_hash":"0d590f10d33a22c18e38da75285216e401e4e964d5b0701cdde0c5cfb516427a"},"summary":"Raise or refuse: the live layers' bundle growth (artifact +174, eager bridge +47 gzip bytes over their old budgets; the comment part is back under its own)","supersedes":"8655f2aeb3861adbeea4196f6dfc8aae6042be25d5bdbf7d46997880c4885481","tags":["live-layers","status:needs-decision","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:55:35.904810Z","id":"e25d98a637d3efe85a02e1fd239e0689c785348f7475137702188c078dd603a0","body":{"detail":"Measured with npm run build && node web/scripts/bundle-size.mjs, each commit built from git archive in a scratch copy: artifact entry 64069 at 66d2a8f3 (the budget before live layers), 64978 at 2c91b082 (rust-int with rust-live-seats and the merges before it, +909), 67072 on rust-agent-drafts alone (+3003 over 66d2a8f3), 67961 after the drafts merge 83ad7424, 64243 on rust-live-layers alone (+174, record 69e407ee), 68131 after the live layers merge 8e6f7e7e. Gallery: 27915 at 66d2a8f3, 27981 at 2c91b082, 27991 on rust-agent-drafts alone, 28048 after both merges, against a budget of 27960. Eager bridge 5547 (budget 5548) and every part are within budget. Only the live layers' growth has a reviewed measured minimum (69e407ee: artifact 64243, bridge 5548); the seats and drafts growth (about 900 and 3000 gzip bytes in the entry, mostly web/shell/src/view/draft-model.ts, web/shell/src/ui/DraftBanner.svelte and the controller's draft and spectator state, which load eagerly) has none, so the budgets stay at 64243 and 27960 and the bundle gate fails. Options: raise artifact to 68131 and gallery to 28048; or move the draft banner and model, and the spectator handling, behind lazy imports and measure again.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":3},"end":{"line":4},"content_hash":"22ba18f2fd9882bbc078f52c81a769741d83a1cbdbc951fea67e25b0a47d4354"},"summary":"The gallery and the artifact entry are over their budgets after the seats, drafts and live layers merges, by more than the live layers' measured minimum","tags":["perf","bundle","status:needs-decision","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:55:47.490450Z","id":"9dfbab6dc1f2756230499d32690de282f28c642f955fd1e6db052ab2c526793c","body":{"detail":"Measured with npm run build && node web/scripts/bundle-size.mjs, each commit built from git archive in a scratch copy: artifact entry 64069 at 66d2a8f3 (the budget before live layers), 64978 at 2c91b082 (rust-int with rust-live-seats and the merges before it, +909), 67072 on rust-agent-drafts alone (+3003 over 66d2a8f3), 67961 after the drafts merge 83ad7424, 64243 on rust-live-layers alone (+174, record 69e407ee), 68131 after the live layers merge 8e6f7e7e. Gallery: 27915 at 66d2a8f3, 27981 at 2c91b082, 27991 on rust-agent-drafts alone, 28048 after both merges, against a budget of 27960. Eager bridge 5547 (budget 5548) and every part are within budget. Only the live layers' growth has a reviewed measured minimum (69e407ee: artifact 64243, bridge 5548); the seats and drafts growth (about 900 and 3000 gzip bytes in the entry; the entry imports the drafts code statically: web/shell/src/ui/StageIsland.svelte imports DraftBanner.svelte and view/draft-model.ts, and view/artifact-controller.ts holds the draft and spectator state; not broken down further) has none, so the budgets stay at 64243 and 27960 and the bundle gate fails. Options: raise artifact to 68131 and gallery to 28048; or move the draft banner and model, and the spectator handling, behind lazy imports and measure again.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":3},"end":{"line":4},"content_hash":"22ba18f2fd9882bbc078f52c81a769741d83a1cbdbc951fea67e25b0a47d4354"},"summary":"The gallery and the artifact entry are over their budgets after the seats, drafts and live layers merges, by more than the live layers' measured minimum","supersedes":"e25d98a637d3efe85a02e1fd239e0689c785348f7475137702188c078dd603a0","tags":["perf","bundle","status:needs-decision","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T06:32:36.375301Z","id":"e9c51084ab6cb5e516a07cd0f0eed390450f7d759a3bd125884eaec75bef0c27","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:e47f7bb0","summary":"Fixed without raising a budget: drafts (view/drafts.ts with DraftBanner.svelte), spectator mode (view/spectator.ts with SpectatorBanner.svelte) and the assets and downloads capability handlers (lazyHandler in caps/registry.ts) load as lazy chunks, and the artifact view's own requests left api.ts. cd web && npm run build && node scripts/bundle-size.mjs at e47f7bb0 prints 'gzip bytes: gallery 27720, artifact 62454, ...' and exits 0 (budgets 27960 and 64243).","supersedes":"9dfbab6dc1f2756230499d32690de282f28c642f955fd1e6db052ab2c526793c","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T04:19:06.766223Z","id":"f5acac29fd4ca2f1e5555e638561e97d1324b74586057a6115073d0311fc258b","body":{"detail":"Measured with web/scripts/bundle-size.mjs at 66d2a8f3: gallery 27915, artifact 64069 (exactly at budget). With hosted mode: gallery 28063 (the dynamic import of web/shell/src/hosted/SignIn.svelte in web/shell/src/gallery-main.ts), artifact 64174 (NO_VIEWER in web/shell/src/threads.ts and the guest_name_required check in web/shell/src/view/artifact-controller.ts submitDraft). `--record` never raises a budget, so the raise is the owner's call. A separate signin.html entry was tried and cost more (the Svelte runtime split into two shared chunks, gallery 28698).","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":3},"end":{"line":4},"content_hash":"799c5034bc32c7c0374713903e3cb556f7a3f514e1681b99dc4540cbddca8b55"},"suggested_fix":"Accept the raise, or move the sign-in pages out of the shell's bundles (server-rendered pages).","summary":"The gallery and artifact budgets were raised by hand for hosted mode (gallery 27960 to 28100, artifact 64069 to 64200)","tags":["status:needs-decision","hosted","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:55:24.322680Z","id":"6f6865fe76a0f488d726e5f2e41d991b62afde308dd104da0fdcb1415e5fd5ae","body":{"kind":"comment","references":"f5acac29fd4ca2f1e5555e638561e97d1324b74586057a6115073d0311fc258b","summary":"Measured after ca2f6431 (npm run build, node scripts/bundle-size.mjs): gallery 28079, artifact 64141 (66d2a8f3: 27915, 64069), both within the raised 28100 and 64200. Of the artifact's +72: the content key in the frame's address 43 (pageAt in web/shell/src/view/artifact-controller.ts, contentSrc's key in web/shell/src/origin.ts), the guest_name_required check 24, the keyed asset URL in web/shell/src/caps/assets.ts 5. A destructuring #each in web/shell/src/hosted/HostedPanel.svelte had pulled Svelte's to_array into the chunk both entries share (+57 to each); ca2f6431 removed it, and moved the no-session viewer to the daemon. Getting to 64069 needs the frame's key without shell code (a cookie-checked redirect from /c/<aid>/v/<n>/ to the keyed address costs a round trip per frame and rests on the frame's navigation carrying the SameSite=Lax cookie).","tags":["session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T06:35:43.507782Z","id":"4601bb3070973ea80eab4becd1872ffd62b6cabc71efe6a8ddfc706302933c6e","body":{"kind":"comment","references":"f5acac29fd4ca2f1e5555e638561e97d1324b74586057a6115073d0311fc258b","summary":"After merging rust-core-hosted-paths and rust-hosted-signin onto rust-int (039d6048), web/scripts/bundle-size.mjs measures gallery 28145 against the raised budget of 28100 and artifact 65047 against 64200, so both are over even with the raise; the spectator mode's code from the seats work is part of the artifact figure. Other entries: questions 14819, people 15085, eager bridge 5462, comment 10825, clip 15004, caps 8144, room 3325, sample 3340.","tags":["session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
