{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-20T00:04:26.824971Z","id":"a78963bd2a1eb4575ef43579e2903ab32c5179161829d2bb11a0b8cd0a6befde","body":{"kind":"comment","references":"28f0e3b73a4e9701d32f13e35b03b0f710869021241aa2f18aae816a3c5117a6","summary":"PromptDialog.svelte loads with the artifact entry again (0199a7cf5 reverts d62f346eb); the budget follows the merged features' cost: 65,000 at 0199a7cf5 (measured 64,728), then 65,200 at 7091a44bd for question Markdown (measured 64,943, 257 bytes left), by bazelisk test //web:bundle_size.","tags":["session:claude-code:d1f51555-8e8f-4c11-acd6-673f773ac34d"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-20T00:04:26.825028Z","id":"5b52a3653d47183245111febd98d00eef430afe5ce19f8ed07d4b149d5b7bcde","body":{"detail":"web/scripts/bundle-size.mjs calls the questions budget the spec's ceiling and never records it. Rendering a question's text through web/shell/src/ui/Markdown.svelte (7091a44bd) brings the component into the q chunk's imports beyond what the gallery has loaded: questions measured 13,537 before and 17,179 after (bazelisk test //web:bundle_size). The owner prefers raising a budget by a feature's real cost to contorting code; the Markdown module itself (view/markdown.ts) still loads on demand.","kind":"waiver","span":{"start":{"line":5},"end":{"line":5},"content_hash":"f431cb1d3adbb7575951a2a34ca3cb0aa3ab1667f81858fadc38c436e73837d7"},"summary":"The question module's budget is 17,500 gzip bytes, above the 16,384 its spec set, for question text rendered as Markdown","tags":["bundle","session:claude-code:d1f51555-8e8f-4c11-acd6-673f773ac34d"]}}
