{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-23T23:15:04.895888Z","id":"9302ccd44a7546c788649ab07071928ea11ba0b8ee5e717ceefa2e8cbc9d5539","body":{"detail":"Measured by bazelisk test //web:bundle_size after 21970cee: transport 2328 gzip bytes, partOrigin 10959; the rule of 647958f22844 (measured + at least 32, rounded up to 64) gives 2368 and 11008. The transport's growth is siteOfUrl and the `site` field of a call in web/shell/src/transport.ts; the origin part's is the relay in web/bridge/src/caps/origin-client.ts and parts/origin.ts relayedSite.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":8},"end":{"line":12},"content_hash":"1dffe41bb53af3ff15a7166ad24f364fbe5955ecebcc362f06a72fd704be3d09"},"summary":"The transport and origin-part budgets were raised by hand for the app's site write relay (transport 2174 to 2368, partOrigin 10900 to 11008)","tags":["bundle","site-origins","session:claude-code:cc23b85c-a691-4093-ab7a-f909d7a53e66"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-24T01:05:08.179756Z","id":"ec49115cad0fb369ce065acb05369cef09bc5a2b0e6683ed482ba7d82187ca29","body":{"kind":"comment","references":"9302ccd44a7546c788649ab07071928ea11ba0b8ee5e717ceefa2e8cbc9d5539","summary":"Raised again, partOrigin 11008 to 11136: //web:bundle_size measured 11042 after c22d0df4 (a db.artifact(id) subscription's slot held in a pending map before its first read, web/bridge/src/caps/origin.ts); the same rule (measured + at least 32, rounded up to 64) gives 11136.","tags":["session:claude-code:cc23b85c-a691-4093-ab7a-f909d7a53e66"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-24T01:45:17.982406Z","id":"2244bd3dc6c78d2a13f322d7077fcfab1ac376fd44a38c8344eb39c271f1e1f4","body":{"detail":"bazel test //web:bundle_size on main (e1ac8d63) measures people 16648; with this branch's People changes rebased onto it (a revoked person's card as a PersonCard with made counts and Reinstate, web/shell/src/people/PersonCard.svelte, People.svelte, model.ts madeText, api.ts reinstatePerson) it measures 16921, 25 over. Every other entry is within its budget. A raise is the owner's: raise people to 17408, or ask for cuts in the revoked card (for example the made line or the Reinstate button's aria-label), which save tens of bytes.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":18},"end":{"line":18},"content_hash":"c1de9ffb7fa474696b4e4440dbf83a83680705773a0ebf7d19cfbd51af70b79e"},"summary":"The People module measures 16921 gzip bytes against its 16896 budget once the reach branch's People changes meet main's, so //web:bundle_size fails","tags":["status:needs-decision","bundle","session:claude-code:5ba3638a-dc4b-4c8f-8349-140e70a28c92"]}}
