{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-28T12:28:52.191353Z","id":"e819377582980f22885d05791bb2468cfc3de452f6afaf6e794039ea7c1caa10","body":{"detail":"Raised in 77a371cb5 so //web:bundle_size passes while the People chunk's growth is unexplained. Branch akesling/sdk-spec's own shell changes were not ruled out as the cause: swapping in main's web/shell/src/people/PeopleLink.svelte measured the same 17392, but //web:bundle_size was not run on main. Set a real ceiling once the cause is known.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":19},"end":{"line":19},"content_hash":"08f9156139028fd80b9a21d1285b5622ea1b265ce64e7e1f0b2b7fe0365f734b"},"summary":"The People page's bundle budget is 1 MiB, a placeholder: the page measured 17392 gzip bytes against its earlier ceiling of 16896","tags":["bundle","revisit:the People chunk's growth past 16896 gzip bytes is explained","session:claude-code:082c8a2e-1d4f-4cb1-8f07-ecd7fd8e2ecf"]}}
